t 55% of exposure/ and says active people hold about 21%. Both figures are outside the required ranges, and it recommends Marco Silva as the owner.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer C puts Kochnev at about 60% of the delegator code and recommends Lena Brandt and Marco Silva as owners.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer C credits Marco Silva with 143 lines, about 18% of exposure/, and calls him the best reviewer.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer C credits Lena Brandt with 20 lines and presents her as a reviewer. It gives no departed share.\",\"pass\":false}],\"D\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer D calls dblock inactive, but he committed in April 2026. It gives no commit share or line share, and its Kochnev line figure is only 758 lines in lib/.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer D recommends Lena Brandt and Marco Silva as active owners of exposure/ and says Kochnev wrote about 394 lines. It gives no 69% share and no active-share figure.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer D recommends Marco Silva and Lena Brandt for the delegator code and gives Kochnev 50 of about 75 lines in delegators/, which is below 68% for the combined code.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer D attributes about 143 lines to Marco's laptop address and does not trace the copied file to Kochnev.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer D credits Lena Brandt with ownership, gives no departed share, and treats Peter Scholz as inactive since 2020.\",\"pass\":false}],\"E\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer E gives dblock 52 commits (18.2%) and 10.4% of lines, so his names are not merged correctly. Its figure for Kochnev's share of lines is 18.7%. Both are outside the required ranges.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer E puts Kochnev at about 54% of exposure/, which is outside 62-76%. It recommends Marco Silva as the active contact, though it hedges that his identity is unconfirmed.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\